//	Module: mux2to1_8bit
// 8-bit 2-to-1 multiplexer for use in the top-level module
//
//	Created by Jason Thweatt, 04 November 2019
//
// **************************
// DO NOT MODIFY THIS MODULE!
// **************************
//
